    <h1 class="msv-hero__title">Opening a Spanish Bank Account as a Foreigner: Complete Guide</h1>
    <p class="msv-hero__intro">A Spanish bank account is one of the first practical things you'll need after arriving — for rent payments, direct debits, utilities, and most administrative purposes. Opening one as a foreigner requires specific documentation and knowing which banks are most accommodating. Here's how to do it.</p>
  </div>
